Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.26,0:00:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Poochie, were you aware?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,An average of 40,000 people\Nvisit the Louvre per day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the most State museum on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It opened August 10th, 1793.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So this guarantees that every single\Nday, it's the most State museum on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,before they decide to\Nleave the museum behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,40,000 humans will choose\Nto see the Mona Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And Venus de Milo.\NFascinating. No. When you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,fascinating do you mean\Nthe numbers let me clarify
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm marveling about how\Nbrilliant artists can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.66,0:00:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,imbue their very souls\Ninto something seen as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.06,0:00:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,merely cold and inanimate\Nas if there stands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.90,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the travel beyond time\Nitself wouldn't you agree
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,An intriguing thought, I admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:01:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're implying that Leonardo da Venice\Nand Alexandros of Antioch are stand-users?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.78,0:01:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.74,0:01:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about you as well, Pucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.66,0:01:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your palesnake has the ability to\Nwholly manifest souls and preserve them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is, are you\Ngoing to betray me someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you attacked me yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.52,0:01:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know that my\Nweakness is the sunlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,which is why I sleep all day in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.70,0:01:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You could easily kill me in my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.30,0:01:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take the world by turning it into\Na disc, you can be king almost instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's never crossed my\Nmind even once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.76,0:01:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I have only admiration for people\Nwho help nurture my growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the king of kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.14,0:01:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's over, where will you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see it through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you with the same reverence\Nand passion as I love God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.60,0:02:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite obvious now I've insulted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.18,0:02:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined I would\None day meet a human who
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,could so effortlessly put\Nme at ease in conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.56,0:02:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You must understand I was afraid of losing\Nyou you'll become a noble priest one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain take that disc do\Nas you will a token of apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have released it from my body\Nto you no matter where you may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.10,0:02:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be secure in knowing\NI will always give you power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Pale Snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Read the memories on that disc\Nand find out where Jolene is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.06,0:03:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me, or can't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a radio\Nrandomly sitting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the guy talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But who the hell is that? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.28,0:03:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a situation where you can't respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I just left the medical\Nwing. That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weather forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, why is it raining now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I must get the disk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have gotten weather\Nforecasts to create this storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming after you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's fog, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a pattern to the\Nsound of those rocks pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Morsecoe, decipher it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This fog isn't thick enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna catch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.88,0:04:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hellsnake's true identity\Nis Father Poochie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That little wretch blew my cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Forecast knows who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Five hundred three Count the prime numbers\NFive oh nine Five hundred twenty-one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All prime numbers and they can't be\Ndivided The reason people succumb to defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.34,0:05:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Five twenty-three Is because of their\Nshame Shame so great it can kill them
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Five Fortun Because of shame, guilt,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.66,0:05:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and disgrace that make\None regret their past
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Actions people become\Nhelpless and weak and cave in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it wasn't a mistake\Nthat i didn't notice the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,guards radio it was a\Ntrial i'll have to use
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,what i've learned to\Nensure victory the only
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.10,0:05:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,saving grace now is jolene\Nkujo still doesn't know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,who i really am therefore\Nit seems nothing has
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,meaningfully changed\Nyet i haven't completely
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,lost sight of her the\Ngenuine victor is the one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,who can conquer and\Ncontrol all living beings
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You managed to make it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are Jolene and the rest of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia, I want you to know I\Nowe you a huge debt of gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You are why I made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, why would you\Ngo through all this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding out Palesnake's\Ntrue identity and taking
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,back my dad's memories\Nis only my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, how do you still\Nnot know the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made my feelings for you clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been amenable\Nto my company, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope that I've never seen\Noutside nor inside prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the real reason I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing is chewing on my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see it's chomping\Nmy hair like noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's eating dirt, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it really is a plan\Nafter all. Feeding itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But then it falls asleep instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh, Jolene, get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's coming over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:07:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's two of them, and they've already\Ngotten way too close for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, I finally found out\Nwho the real pale snake is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's Father Poochie. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.82,0:07:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the one who did this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost bit the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If Father Forecast hadn't\Nshown up, I'd be dead for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.22,0:07:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.24,0:07:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay, just had to ditch the skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you guys able to handle your side?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your right eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll treat it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.05,0:07:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What you just said before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that asshole priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He was trying to find the baby, but\Nthis time using D &G's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.50,0:07:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do now is hunt him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,With weather forecast too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Victories are on the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:07:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Have all your wounds from\Nthe factory healed up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but what is\Nsuddenly happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do they think they're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hugging, you dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, that was rhetorical.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, go separate them. I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull them apart right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I certainly can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, we made a deal\Nthat you would help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry, he's getting\Nhis scent all over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, cool it, Crisscross.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just saying hi to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.55,0:08:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.47,0:08:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit getting your panties in a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.92,0:08:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We found out Father Poochie is the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so save your tangent\Nfor another time, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you actually talking back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives you the audacity?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you've totally\Nabandoned our contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but lowly plankton.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,now that we know Pale Snake's identity,\Nlet's dispatch our tiny companion, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for it,\Nso I'll go handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need now is your\Nconsent, Jolene. Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This pathetic creature isn't an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not even human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned,\Nit shouldn't even exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.84,0:09:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lower than creeping fungus\Non a rock born as a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what evil it\Ncould be capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your consent. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, tough guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking shit about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You should really watch your mouth\Nor - Get your filthy hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now isn't the time for\Nyour nonsense, Plankton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I want your consent as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're the one who's going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, I don't think you know\Nwho you brought with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:09:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:09:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you've really done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He isn't Weather Forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this guy, this\Nguy is just an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for leading the way for me, FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Very nice of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I could make it\Nwith plenty of time before
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the real weather forecast\Ncould ruin everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,547, 557, prime numbers are\Nunbreakable and indivisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.98,0:10:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I never believed this\Nday would truly come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,After 22 years, the place that exists\Nbeyond the pinnacle of human achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.18,0:10:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,After decades of searching,\NI finally found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The direct path to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,True, it's still imperfect and premature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But all that's left now is to follow\Nthe memory sealed by Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:10:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a new moon tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I will awaken you and\Nit will be time for a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,heaven gloriously fitting\Nfor me to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The 36 jammed souls of those who\Nonce committed heinous crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The pure new being born from that soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the living embodiment right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, of course, very quickly\Nbefore we get into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I must cast you into the\Nperfect oblivion of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.42,0:11:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You must know it was\Nalways leading up to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, daughter of Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who barely\Nprotected your vital point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.52,0:11:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't come to me, I'll indulge\Nyour stubbornness and come to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pale snake, you piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I know who you are now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but I never once thought I would\Nfind out the way that I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.74,0:11:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially meeting you\Nagain now, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:11:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You have three big things\NI plan to take back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,One, my dad's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, the disc you stole from FF's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.66,0:12:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And most importantly, your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you possibly\Nuse handcuffs on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.26,0:12:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This your first time in cuffs?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks to your dirty little scheme,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been wearing them practically\Nevery day since I was dragged here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You think these measly bracelets\Ncan contain me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.68,0:12:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think handcuffs are for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not for preventing\Nescape, criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They're for forcing your surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:13:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel compelled to mention you don't\Nquite seem to understand what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,See, these handcuffs put us\Nin straight mutual contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm curious to know\Nwhat you think it's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly which one of us\Nis being captured here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your treasured stone ocean stand\Nhas just been turned into a disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can easily coax it out of you. Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When it all boils down, which one of us is\Nan irretrievably dire strait? You or me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand it one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,At least that's what I've come to realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.74,0:13:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A few millimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A few millimeters and\Nthis will all be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that's literally all the forward\Nmovement towards you I'd need right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can bash your face in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine swallows that fly\Nstraight into cliffs so they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impractical and tragic,\Nbut they fly at skewed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.78,0:13:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,dangerous angles almost\Nsure to get them killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.22,0:14:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Their parents never taught\Nthem to fly in safe loops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But it isn't because the\Nparents chose not to teach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.76,0:14:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because they're unable to teach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,since they've never learned\Nfrom their parents either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.38,0:14:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Many swallows don't live very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't even realize they're\Npredisposed to those fatal accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.14,0:14:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe Jotaro was just such a swallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, your stone ocean is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did she know when I blinded\Nher with the disc it doesn't make sense
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,is she feeling it from These cuffs
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,vibrations oh I see it's intimidation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that's it she's using intimidation\Nto detect and Fend off my attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.22,0:14:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think she even possessed\Ndamn powers when she arrived at the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she was just a pathetic girl,\Nwasting her tears on a man who deceived
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.57,0:15:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This stand may be too\Nstrong for Palesnake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running out of time fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of all, the newly\Nborn entity will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you throw?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you, what did\Nyou just throw at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.14,0:15:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Discs are souls in\Nconvenient material form.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They can be preserved for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if a disc enters\Nthe body of someone dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it will simply fade out\Nand die along with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And no matter what you attempt to do,\Nyou will never be able to resurrect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.14,0:15:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That is Jotro's disc you've\Nbeen risking your life for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why waste time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.78,0:15:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a better thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:15:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I could put it in his body instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I gouged the thing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to pull the disc out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.94,0:16:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you going to continue\Nwith this ridiculous deathmatch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,To jettison Jotro's disc could indeed\Nbe disastrous, but I fear nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already read and memorized\Nhow to get straight to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left to do is execute it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So Jolene Kujo, what's it going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.12,0:16:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no longer an ultimate decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.16,0:16:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father's being dragged\Nto his death with Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you dead inside too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All I really want and need now is\Nto obtain the newly born being.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected, she chose her father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Spiral Stairs, The Beetle,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:17:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandoned Town, Fiktard,\NBeetle, The Path to Dolorosa
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Beetle, Singularity, Giotto, Angel, Hydrangea,\NBeetle, Singularity, Secret, Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be your showing\Ninterest in this will
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.08,0:17:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you come to me quickly\Nof your own volition?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.52,0:17:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Will this be the new\Nbeginning of everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bless you my child now we can both enter\Nyour world together hallelujah beloved Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be. Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:17:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me how.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen? Help! Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.74,0:18:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone around?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.36,0:18:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm desperate. Guards! Over here! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.77,0:18:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Can anyone hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Diver, drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, FF, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.02,0:18:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Choline's grieving. She's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This tragedy happened all because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'm so cold and getting\Ncolder with every passing moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart has almost stopped\Nbeating entirely already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Her father's disc was put\Ninside me, and if I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,which appears very likely, it too\Nwill certainly perish forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.72,0:18:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I truly struggle to remove it from my\Nbody, but my consciousness is almost gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.42,0:19:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears you're disintegrating\Nand degenerating quickly, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.70,0:19:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you all I have\Nleft, but you must do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to use my intellect and\Nwhatever small flicker remains of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Use everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.62,0:19:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to use that\Nto reach inside my body
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and take the disc out\Nbecause Jolene needs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.36,0:19:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Only you, the plankton, can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.54,0:19:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,F .F., please, answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you and I made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.66,0:19:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,that you would hear\Nand obey all my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.56,0:19:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you break our promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to live on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you do to my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.98,0:19:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My consciousness is fading away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.40,0:19:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this cannot be happening. Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.14,0:19:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.48,0:20:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The good news is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.42,0:20:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.34,0:20:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He recovered the disc. It's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.90,0:20:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,FF? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the one doing the talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I think what I was most afraid of...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,was having to leave my\Nfriends behind without
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,even having any time\Nto say goodbye to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.67,0:20:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,When the end finally came, I found\Nthe strength and courage to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, when Anastasia comes\Nto you, please tell him this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body is yours alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I patched and healed your wounds with your\Nintelligence and your potent life force.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No! FF, wait! Goodbye, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My time here is finally up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you know is FF will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:20:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy, I don't believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, it's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What you see right now is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my intellect, my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's proof I was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get your disc, FF's\Ndisc, back from that priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.72,0:21:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I promise you, you'll\Ncome back to life and stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.86,0:21:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But that'll be a different FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The me you know won't be in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the true me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I could just say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have left\Nyou without doing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.48,0:21:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.44,0:21:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.02,0:21:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's my promise to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.60,0:21:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you finally got the disc back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,F .F., no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.36,0:21:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, F .F.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't track you. Do you copy? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.62,0:22:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.26,0:22:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,F .F., hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.90,0:22:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, F .F. Acknowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.34,0:22:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huff, huff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.16,0:22:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Place other than here,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.10,0:22:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.16,0:22:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,inside and all the while,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.40,0:22:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,About my destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All the things!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.78,0:23:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.96,0:23:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.66,0:23:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.76,0:23:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,From today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.66,0:24:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.28,0:24:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
